          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"about.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>About — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#fbf7f3;--card:#fff7f0;--accent:#8a5a3b;--muted:#7b6a63;--shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(134,102,83,0.12);font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial}\\n    body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:#2f2a27;line-height:1.5}\\n    .wrap{max-width:980px;margin:36px auto;padding:28px}\\n    nav{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\\n    .nav-left{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}\\n    .brand{font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)}\\n    .nav-links a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:8px}\\n    .nav-links a:hover{background:#fff2ea}\\n    header.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:28px;align-items:center;margin-top:22px}\\n    .hero-card{background:var(--card);padding:26px;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}\\n    .eyebrow{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px}\\n    h1{margin:0 0 10px 0;font-size:28px}\\n    p.lead{margin:0 0 18px;color:#3d352f}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none}\\n    .meta{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:12px}\\n    .avatar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}\\n    .avatar svg{width:72px;height:72px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 8px 18px rgba(138,90,59,0.08)}\\n    section{margin-top:28px}\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px}\\n    .card{background:#fff;padding:16px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 14px rgba(100,72,59,0.06)}\\n    .case{background:#fff8f3;padding:14px;border-radius:10px}\\n    footer{margin-top:36px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid #f0e6e2;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .small{font-size:13px;color:#6a5b54}\\n    @media (max-width:880px){header.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}\\n      .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}\\n    }\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <nav>\\n      <div class=\\\"nav-left\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"brand\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"nav-links\\\">\\n          <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n          <a href=\\\"about.html\\\" aria-current=\\\"page\\\">About</a>\\n          <a href=\\\"specialties.html\\\">Areas</a>\\n          <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">Approach</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"nav-right\\\">\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:none;background:#fff;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;color:var(--accent);\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </nav>\\n\\n    <header class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"hero-card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"eyebrow\\\">About</div>\\n        <h1>Calm, practical therapy for people navigating change</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">I work with adults who are facing anxiety, relationship strain, life transitions, burnout, and the lingering effects of earlier trauma. My practice blends evidence-informed tools with a collaborative, compassionate stance.</p>\\n        <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n        <div class=\\\"meta\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"avatar\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\">\\n            <!-- inline unique avatar svg for about page -->\\n            <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 72 72\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" role=\\\"img\\\" aria-label=\\\"Therapist avatar\\\">\\n              <rect width=\\\"72\\\" height=\\\"72\\\" rx=\\\"12\\\" fill=\\\"#f7efe9\\\"/>\\n              <circle cx=\\\"36\\\" cy=\\\"26\\\" r=\\\"12\\\" fill=\\\"#8a5a3b\\\" opacity=\\\"0.12\\\"/>\\n              <circle cx=\\\"36\\\" cy=\\\"26\\\" r=\\\"10\\\" fill=\\\"#c99678\\\"/>\\n              <rect x=\\\"22\\\" y=\\\"40\\\" width=\\\"28\\\" height=\\\"18\\\" rx=\\\"6\\\" fill=\\\"#dcae95\\\"/>\\n              <path d=\\\"M30 48c4 2 8 2 12 0\\\" stroke=\\\"#8a5a3b\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.6\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\"/>\\n            </svg>\\n            <div>\\n              <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{THERAPIST_NAME}}, {{LICENSE}}</div>\\n              <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:4px\\\">Offers individual therapy • {{MODALITIES}}</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div style=\\\"align-self:start\\\">\\n        <!-- organic hero svg unique to about -->\\n        <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 320 240\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" role=\\\"img\\\" aria-label=\\\"warm shapes\\\">\\n          <defs>\\n            <linearGradient id=\\\"g1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#fde7db\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#f6d6c1\\\"/></linearGradient>\\n          </defs>\\n          <rect width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" rx=\\\"16\\\" fill=\\\"url(#g1)\\\"/>\\n          <g opacity=\\\"0.14\\\" fill=\\\"#8a5a3b\\\">\\n            <ellipse cx=\\\"250\\\" cy=\\\"40\\\" rx=\\\"44\\\" ry=\\\"22\\\"/>\\n            <ellipse cx=\\\"48\\\" cy=\\\"190\\\" rx=\\\"70\\\" ry=\\\"30\\\"/>\\n          </g>\\n          <path d=\\\"M40 120c28-36 120-40 180-8\\\" stroke=\\\"#b87458\\\" stroke-width=\\\"6\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" opacity=\\\"0.9\\\"/>\\n        </svg>\\n      </div>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <section aria-labelledby=\\\"philosophy\\\">\\n      <h2 id=\\\"philosophy\\\">Core principles that guide my work</h2>\\n      <div class=\\\"grid\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <strong>Safety first</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">Therapy is paced to match what feels tolerable. We prioritize regulation and predictability before deeper exploration.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <strong>Skillful clarity</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">Practical tools are taught with context — not as one-size-fits-all fixes, but as experiments you can tailor to your life.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <strong>Agency & partnership</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">You remain the author of change. My role is to reflect patterns, offer approaches, and co-design steps that feel meaningful.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section aria-labelledby=\\\"misconceptions\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:22px\\\">\\n      <h2 id=\\\"misconceptions\\\">Common misconceptions — and a different view</h2>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:grid;gap:10px;margin-top:10px\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"case\\\">\\n          <strong>Myth:</strong> Therapy will tell me what to do.\\n          <div class=\\\"small\\\">Truth: Effective therapy helps you discover choices and practice them safely. I aim to expand options rather than prescribe a single path.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"case\\\">\\n          <strong>Myth:</strong> Progress should be steady.\\n          <div class=\\\"small\\\">Truth: Healing is often non-linear — that’s normal. We track signals and adjust pace so gains sustain over time.</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section aria-labelledby=\\\"stories\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:22px\\\">\\n      <h2 id=\\\"stories\\\">Illustrative vignettes (anonymized)</h2>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:grid;gap:12px;margin-top:10px\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <strong>Rebuilding after burnout</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">A client shifted from chronic overwork to a sustainable routine by clarifying values, boundary experiments, and weekly pacing. The work emphasized small, repeatable changes.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <strong>Repairing communication</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">Couple-focused sessions helped a client learn to speak up earlier and notice when old avoidance patterns reappeared. We practiced short phrases and timing adjustments.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section aria-labelledby=\\\"faq\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:22px\\\">\\n      <h2 id=\\\"faq\\\">Questions people often ask</h2>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">\\n        <details>\\n          <summary>What does a first session look like?</summary>\\n          <div class=\\\"small\\\">We spend time understanding your concerns, immediate stressors, and goals. I review confidentiality and typical logistics. We'll leave with a small experimental step.</div>\\n        </details>\\n        <details>\\n          <summary>How long will therapy take?</summary>\\n          <div class=\\\"small\\\">This varies. Some people benefit from short-term focused work; others prefer ongoing continuity. We'll discuss a plan that fits your needs and schedule.</div>\\n        </details>\\n        <details>\\n          <summary>Are sessions confidential?</summary>\\n          <div class=\\\"small\\\">Yes — with standard limits (risk of harm to self/others, court orders, mandated reporting). See the privacy note in the footer for scope and boundaries.</div>\\n        </details>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:24px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:18px\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Ready to begin?</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"small\\\">Telehealth available in {{STATE}}; in-person in {{CITY}} where noted.</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Book a visit — {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div class=\\\"small\\\">{{THERAPIST_NAME}}, {{LICENSE}} — {{BUSINESS_NAME}} • Contact: <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a> • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px;color:#6b5f58;font-size:13px\\\">Confidentiality & scope: Conversations are confidential except in situations required by law (e.g., imminent risk or court order). I provide psychotherapy within my professional training and license. If you are in crisis or at immediate risk, call local emergency services or your crisis line; this website is not an emergency service.</div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"specialties.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Specialties & Services — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#fffaf6;--muted:#6b5f58;--accent:#8a5a3b;--card:#fff;--shadow:0 10px 22px rgba(138,90,59,0.06);font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto}\\n    body{background:var(--bg);margin:0;color:#2f2a27}\\n    .wrap{max-width:980px;margin:28px auto;padding:26px}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px}\\n    .brand{font-weight:800;color:var(--accent)}\\n    .nav{display:flex;gap:12px}\\n    .nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:8px}\\n    .hero{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff7f0 0%,#fffaf6 100%);padding:22px;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center}\\n    h1{margin:0;font-size:24px}\\n    .sub{color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px}\\n    .list{margin-top:18px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}\\n    .spec{background:var(--card);padding:14px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #f3e6de}\\n    .pill{display:inline-block;background:#fff2ea;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;font-size:13px;color:var(--accent)}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none}\\n    footer{margin-top:26px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    @media (max-width:760px){.list{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div>\\n        <div class=\\\"brand\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"nav\\\">\\n          <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Overview</a>\\n          <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">Story</a>\\n          <a href=\\\"specialties.html\\\" aria-current=\\\"page\\\">Expertise</a>\\n          <a href=\\\"fees.html\\\">Fees</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:none;color:var(--accent)\\\">Contact</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:16px\\\" class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <h1>Where I focus my clinical work</h1>\\n        <div class=\\\"sub\\\">A pragmatic, individualized approach for adults. I blend cognitive-behavioral tools, somatic awareness, and relational practice.</div>\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\"><span class=\\\"pill\\\">Modalities: {{MODALITIES}}</span></div>\\n      </div>\\n      <!-- unique pattern svg for specialties page -->\\n      <svg width=\\\"160\\\" height=\\\"120\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 160 120\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" role=\\\"img\\\" aria-label=\\\"organic pattern\\\">\\n        <rect width=\\\"160\\\" height=\\\"120\\\" rx=\\\"12\\\" fill=\\\"#fffaf6\\\" stroke=\\\"#fde7db\\\"/>\\n        <g fill=\\\"#f6d6c1\\\" opacity=\\\"0.9\\\">\\n          <circle cx=\\\"28\\\" cy=\\\"32\\\" r=\\\"18\\\"/>\\n          <circle cx=\\\"120\\\" cy=\\\"20\\\" r=\\\"12\\\"/>\\n          <ellipse cx=\\\"90\\\" cy=\\\"88\\\" rx=\\\"42\\\" ry=\\\"14\\\"/>\\n        </g>\\n      </svg>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n      <h2>Primary areas of support</h2>\\n      <p class=\\\"sub\\\">Below are common concerns I work with — each entry includes the kinds of steps we typically explore together.</p>\\n      <div class=\\\"list\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"spec\\\">\\n          <strong>Anxiety & panic</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">Psychoeducation, grounding and breathing skills, graded exposure to situations, and cognitive restructuring when helpful.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"spec\\\">\\n          <strong>Trauma-related symptoms</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">Stabilization, titrated memory processing, and resources to manage physiological activation. Emphasis on safety and pacing.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"spec\\\">\\n          <strong>Relationship challenges</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">Communication experiments, pattern recognition, and setting boundaries. Work may include individual sessions focused on relational skills.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"spec\\\">\\n          <strong>Life transitions & grief</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">Meaning-focused conversations, problem solving, and values clarification to help orient next steps after loss or change.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"spec\\\">\\n          <strong>Burnout & workplace strain</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">Assessing workload, pacing, compassionate self-direction, and small behavioral shifts to protect capacity.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"spec\\\">\\n          <strong>Identity & developmental work</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">Exploring sense of self, belonging, and the transitions that accompany identity shifts across adulthood.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:20px\\\">\\n      <h2>How I structure care</h2>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:10px\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"background:#fff;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);width:240px\\\">\\n          <strong>Focused Block</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"small\\\">6–12 sessions designed around a single concern or skill set. Clear goals and measurable steps.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style=\\\"background:#fff;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);width:240px\\\">\\n          <strong>Continuity Membership</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"small\\\">Ongoing weekly or biweekly sessions for people wanting deeper change and relational continuity. (Payment plans available.)</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:20px\\\">\\n      <h2>Brief stories</h2>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:grid;gap:10px;margin-top:8px\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"spec\\\">\\n          <strong>From overwhelm to small experiments</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">A person reorganized a chaotic morning routine into three reliable steps over four weeks, reducing daily anxiety spikes.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"spec\\\">\\n          <strong>Reentering relationships after loss</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">We worked on tolerating uncertainty and slowly practicing presence; outcomes emphasized improved curiosity over perfection.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:20px\\\">\\n      <h2>Common questions about specialties</h2>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">\\n        <details>\\n          <summary>Do you treat trauma?</summary>\\n          <div class=\\\"small\\\">Yes. I focus first on safety and stabilization. When we approach memory work, it's paced and evidence-informed. We’ll discuss options and consent before moving forward.</div>\\n        </details>\\n        <details>\\n          <summary>Is telehealth an option?</summary>\\n          <div class=\\\"small\\\">Yes. I offer telehealth throughout {{STATE}} and some in-person availability in {{CITY}}. We'll choose what fits your needs.</div>\\n        </details>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:22px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Interested in a focused block or ongoing care?</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"small\\\">I can help you choose a format that fits your goals and schedule.</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Start the conversation</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div class=\\\"small\\\">{{THERAPIST_NAME}}, {{LICENSE}} • {{BUSINESS_NAME}} • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> • <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></div>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Privacy & limits: Your sessions are confidential within professional and legal limits. I do not provide emergency services. If you are at immediate risk, please call local emergency services or your crisis line.</div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"approach.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Therapeutic Approach — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#fbf8f6;--accent:#7a4e37;--muted:#6a5b54;--card:#fff;--shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(122,78,55,0.06);font-family:Inter,system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI'}\\n    body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:#2f2a27}\\n    .wrap{max-width:980px;margin:30px auto;padding:30px}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n    .brand{font-weight:800;color:var(--accent)}\\n    .nav{display:flex;gap:12px}\\n    .nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}\\n    .intro{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fffaf2, #fff7f0);padding:20px;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);margin-top:18px}\\n    .steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:16px}\\n    .step{background:var(--card);padding:14px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #f3e6de}\\n    .mini-cta{display:inline-block;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none}\\n    footer{margin-top:26px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    @media (max-width:860px){.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div class=\\\"brand\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n      <nav class=\\\"nav\\\">\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Portal</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"specialties.html\\\">Paths</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\" aria-current=\\\"page\\\">Method</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"intro\\\">\\n      <h1>How I work — an overview of method and collaboration</h1>\\n      <p class=\\\"small\\\">My approach is integrative, pragmatic, and paced to what each person can tolerate. I combine cognitive-behavioral techniques, somatic awareness, and relational learning. Most importantly, we co-design the pace and goals.</p>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <a class=\\\"mini-cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Schedule a consult</a>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Telehealth available across {{STATE}}</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n      <h2>Three practical pathways I offer</h2>\\n      <div class=\\\"steps\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n          <strong>1) Foundation Track</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">Short-term, skills-forward work (6–10 sessions) to build regulation, communication tools, and clear behavioral experiments.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n          <strong>2) Stabilize & Process</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">For people who want pacing and intermittent processing of distressing material. Emphasizes safety, grounding, and consented memory work when ready.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n          <strong>3) Continuity Membership</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">Ongoing weekly/biweekly sessions for those who value relational continuity, deeper exploration, or complex difficulties. Includes priority scheduling and brief check-ins between sessions as appropriate.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n          <strong>How we choose a pathway</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">We discuss immediate needs, time availability, and preferences. Treatment is revisited regularly so plans stay responsive to change.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n      <h2>Tools & influences</h2>\\n      <p class=\\\"small\\\">I draw from evidence-informed practices: CBT, acceptance-based strategies, EMDR-informed thinking (where appropriate and consensual), somatic regulation, and relational frameworks. Interventions are chosen based on their fit for you rather than ideology.</p>\\n\\n      <!-- unique subtle pattern svg used as divider for approach page -->\\n      <svg width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"48\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 800 48\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" role=\\\"img\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n        <defs><linearGradient id=\\\"pg\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#fff2ea\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#f7e0d5\\\"/></linearGradient></defs>\\n        <rect width=\\\"800\\\" height=\\\"48\\\" fill=\\\"url(#pg)\\\"/>\\n        <g fill=\\\"#e9c9b5\\\" opacity=\\\"0.6\\\">\\n          <ellipse cx=\\\"60\\\" cy=\\\"24\\\" rx=\\\"40\\\" ry=\\\"12\\\"/>\\n          <ellipse cx=\\\"300\\\" cy=\\\"24\\\" rx=\\\"60\\\" ry=\\\"18\\\"/>\\n          <ellipse cx=\\\"640\\\" cy=\\\"24\\\" rx=\\\"36\\\" ry=\\\"10\\\"/>\\n        </g>\\n      </svg>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n      <h2>What to expect in session</h2>\\n      <ol style=\\\"margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n        <li>We begin with what matters most to you today and your current coping capacity.</li>\\n        <li>We identify one or two experiments or skills to practice between sessions.</li>\\n        <li>We reflect on results and adjust — therapy is iterative and collaborative.</li>\\n      </ol>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n      <h2>Representative short cases</h2>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:grid;gap:10px;margin-top:8px\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"background:#fff;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #f3e6de\\\">\\n          <strong>Gradual exposure to social anxiety</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">Over 8 weeks a client used gradual experiments and interoceptive work to reduce avoidance and try new social roles; focus was on tolerating discomfort and noticing evidence.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style=\\\"background:#fff;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #f3e6de\\\">\\n          <strong>From overwhelm to structure</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">A partnership to redesign daily margins — small boundary experiments helped protect energy and lowered reactivity at work.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n      <h2>Questions about method</h2>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">\\n        <details>\\n          <summary>Will you use EMDR or memory processing?</summary>\\n          <div class=\\\"small\\\">If memory-processing approaches are clinically appropriate and you consent, we discuss the rationale and alternatives. Any such work is paced and preceded by stabilization.</div>\\n        </details>\\n        <details>\\n          <summary>Do you give homework?</summary>\\n          <div class=\\\"small\\\">Often. Assignments are collaborative, brief, and designed to provide information rather than to be performance tasks. We tailor them to your life and capacity.</div>\\n        </details>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:22px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Want to talk through which pathway fits?</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"small\\\">I offer an initial consult to discuss goals and recommend a structure.</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <a class=\\\"mini-cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Request a consult</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div class=\\\"small\\\">{{THERAPIST_NAME}}, {{LICENSE}} • {{BUSINESS_NAME}} • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> • <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></div>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Confidentiality & limits: Your therapy is confidential within legal limits (imminent harm, mandated reporting, or legal processes). This site is informational and not a crisis response; if you are in immediate danger, call emergency services.</div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
        }
      ],
